                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                      %mi L
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [L]
                is the K-theory class of any line bundle,
            %li
              %p
